     2081               v-torgconf-self-host-egrip-num      = "":U
     2082           .
     2083       end.
     2084       else do:
     2085           run fmtcli-get-client in this-procedure (
     2086                 input 'орг':U
     2087               , input v-torgconf-self-host-code
     2088           ).
